    "body": "Switch our CDash submissions from my.cdash.org to our self-hosted instance at https://cdash.fish.foo/index.php?project=bitcoin-core.\n\nmy.cdash.org sometimes deletes our logs extremely quickly. That leaves too little time to investigate failures and makes links to earlier results 404, which is annoying.\n\nThe new instance runs on a dedicated Hetzner VPS and gives us control over retention. Submissions are configured to be retained for 90 days, and the project's build retention is also set to 90 days.\n\nThis also changes the nightly start time from `00:00 UTC` to `01:23 UTC` (slightly \"randomised\" from 00:00 to reduce contention on nightlies).",
