      "message": "ci: Switch to self-hosted CDash\n\nmy.cdash.org sometimes deletes our logs in under a week, leaving too\nlittle time to investigate failures or refer back to earlier results.\n\nSubmit results to cdash.fish.foo, our own CDash instance hosted on a\ndedicated Hetzner VPS, so we can control retention. It is currently\nconfigured to retain log submissions for 90 days.\n\nAlso switch the nightly start time with the new instance's 01:23 UTC.",
